{"id":"621c53338dce3f6f022584e10801fb10f7ff69dc","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1251671","title":"有没有感觉 Codex 越来越比不上 Claude 了","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"Wenwener","excerpt":"问与答 - @Wenwener -","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Wrapper\">\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18218780\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/099b/a65d/45554_normal.png?m=1725955966\" alt=\"v2gba\" data-uid=\"45554\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/v2gba\">v2gba</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-25 18:43:14 +08:00\">1 day ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>除了 astra~opus5.5 的期间, 综合考虑都比不上吧. (个人使用下来的综合评分)</p><p>当然我觉得 Codex 还是有不少比 Claude 好的地方. 依旧保持双持的状态.</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18218788\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/d0fcb880781c7f67dd112d1bc5f3926d?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"ififi\" data-uid=\"241740\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ififi\">ififi</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-25 18:50:34 +08:00\">1 day ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>今天刚被 Claude 封，一下从 Opus 5.5 切到 Astra 和 6.1 Sol 。<br>第一感觉就是慢，第二感觉就是笨。戒断反应来了。<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/5FDsp6L.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5FDsp6L.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a></p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18218795\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/d0fcb880781c7f67dd112d1bc5f3926d?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"ififi\" data-uid=\"241740\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ififi\">ififi</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-25 18:53:48 +08:00\">1 day ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/ififi\">ififi</a> 补充：<br>Claude Design 和 Canvas 功能也是独一档。<br>Max 5x 的耐用程度远超 Pro 100 刀。<br>要不是 Tibo 搞的三天两头重置，人估计都跑 Claude 去了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18218807\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/6f7b/82ab/346271_normal.png?m=1740789816\" alt=\"zfyime\" data-uid=\"346271\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/zfyime\">zfyime</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-25 19:03:04 +08:00\">1 day ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>起码编程方面是<br>opus-4.5 一路用过来<br>gpt 从来没有能代替的时候  永远啰里八嗦 无效兜底 车轱辘话 分散的屎山代码往上糊</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18218927\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4785/4493/92591_normal.png?m=1734608879\" alt=\"111111111111\" data-uid=\"92591\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/111111111111\">111111111111</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-25 21:02:41 +08:00\">22h 30m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>claude web 和 chatgpt 感觉差别不大<br>claude code 和 codex 的差距明显，<br>不知道为什么</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18218968\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/2d8f/02e5/99039_normal.png?m=1548847857\" alt=\"coderlxm\" data-uid=\"99039\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/coderlxm\">coderlxm</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-25 21:43:42 +08:00\">21h 49m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>从 opus5.5 发布到现在这段时间差距太明显了，基本上是不可用的状态。不过我说句暴论，要是 a 畜不封号，涌进来的用户量也会分分钟把 opus 降智到 luna 的水平。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18218987\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/57823db031658e514938332388d67079?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"skylong8\" data-uid=\"681810\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/skylong8\">skylong8</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-25 21:56:08 +08:00\">21h 36m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 3</span>\n                    \n                    <p>我之所以现在还在用 Codex 是因为 Claude 会封号。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18219000\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0c31/0dbc/173924_normal.png?m=1788497681\" alt=\"liudon\" data-uid=\"173924\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/liudon\">liudon</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-25 22:06:52 +08:00\">21h 26m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>十一假期回来，又慢又笨。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18219081\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/2c2e507d4eee834893a9f98ff10153b8?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"dragonQueen\" data-uid=\"548807\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/dragonQueen\">dragonQueen</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-25 23:03:18 +08:00\">20h 29m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我是主要觉得 claude 的自动模式太香了，几乎不需要手动确认了； codex 的即使开了 full access ，偶尔也还是需要手动授权。要是睡之前开个任务，claude 基本上第二天早上能交付，但是 codex 就看运气了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18219090\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/80ac/32fc/580231_normal.png?m=1755248272\" alt=\"ndxxx\" data-uid=\"580231\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ndxxx\">ndxxx</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-25 23:08:15 +08:00\">20h 24m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>都在用，opus5.5 medium 和 sol6.1 medium 用来 coding 体感差距不大（ fable 和 astra 我嫌慢且体会不到相对于本家 opus 和 sol 的编码提升），当然前提是我给到的设计文档质量足够。许愿式编码确实 opus5.5 更胜一筹😁</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18219142\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/0d477d0a6d67ec2d7eeb09a3fe544a5a?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"vverr\" data-uid=\"477915\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>17</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/vverr\">vverr</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-25 23:44:07 +08:00\">19h 48m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>TMD 之前速度还行 今天频繁报 429 啊</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18219145\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/131d93dcab57a38bc8894f720efde3e4?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"cctv180\" data-uid=\"533234\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>18</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/cctv180\">cctv180</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-25 23:48:56 +08:00\">19h 44m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>curso 用户路过，爱调用 opus-5-5 模型，很少使用 gemini 和 gpt 模型</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18219154\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f312/8e77/398731_normal.png?m=1563948246\" alt=\"loopq\" data-uid=\"398731\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>19</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/loopq\">loopq</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-25 23:57:45 +08:00\">19h 35m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>O 家，gpt5.6 前后体验天壤之别，后面就算给我重置也不太想用了，又慢又蠢。Astra 贵的离谱<br>Claude Pro 用量挺多的，我记得几个月之前 Pro 用量也是很少的，后面对抗 O 重置有 50% 活动之后，也是能当主力用段时间，可以完整规划然后用其他模型实施了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18219158\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/762d/d577/19959_normal.png?m=1723165448\" alt=\"Alwaysonline\" data-uid=\"19959\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>20</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Alwaysonline\">Alwaysonline</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-26 00:03:07 +08:00\">19h 29m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <div><p>Claude 是你仰慕佩服的技术大拿， <br>Codex 是刚分配给你带的新人。</p><p>真没招 A/ 完全不给人机会用，封号到无助。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18219160\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a7f6/71c6/647341_normal.png?m=1750237884\" alt=\"lambdaX999\" data-uid=\"647341\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>21</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/lambdaX999\">lambdaX999</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-26 00:07:05 +08:00\">19h 25m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>codex 能力还是可以，就是这个 5 小时额度给的太少了，如果用量加大点还是可以跟 opus 打的有来有回，估计是 sam 这边算力不够了，opus 现在有了 elon 的算力加持，感觉是要对 codex 进行围剿了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18219194\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/efdb3c1b3ca7ce4165fb73590619237c?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"HappyAndSmile\" data-uid=\"457829\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>23</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/HappyAndSmile\">HappyAndSmile</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-26 01:17:37 +08:00\">18h 15m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>我刚刚今晚花了 300 人民币在 claude 中转里，我有大量 Codex 都不用，怎么说，没办法啊，一遇到关键问题，Codex 就完成不了，只能用 claude 去搞定。谁要是跟我说 Codex 差不多的话，我都是笑笑不说话</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18219201\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/cf02/6e97/265248_normal.png?m=1759562067\" alt=\"dxppp\" data-uid=\"265248\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>24</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/dxppp\">dxppp</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-26 01:44:39 +08:00\">17h 48m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>所以我都 AI Orchestration <br>Claude Opus 5.5 当 Supervisor 监督 GPT 这些 Workers 干活 效果不错</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18219203\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/bf0ce26403b52abe597bb29bd8e22ccb?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"yang1iu\" data-uid=\"635959\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>25</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yang1iu\">yang1iu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-26 02:19:42 +08:00\">17h 13m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>不是越来越比不上，是一直没比上过</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18219399\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/e497/3dc7/605325_normal.png?m=1771246484\" alt=\"Ethkuil\" data-uid=\"605325\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>27</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Ethkuil\">Ethkuil</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-26 09:01:50 +08:00\">10h 31m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>跟 Claude Opus 5.5 合作身心愉悦，跟 Astra 合作血压升高。对我来说真的差距很大。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18219404\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/131c/3a21/146090_normal.png?m=1747798901\" alt=\"elevioux\" data-uid=\"146090\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>28</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/elevioux\">elevioux</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-26 09:02:50 +08:00\">10h 30m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>opeanai 相比 anthropic ，感觉 opanai 才是那个跟随者，无论模型能力还是 harness 本身。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18219409\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/e497/3dc7/605325_normal.png?m=1771246484\" alt=\"Ethkuil\" data-uid=\"605325\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>29</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Ethkuil\">Ethkuil</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-26 09:03:26 +08:00\">10h 29m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>做事能力、写文档能力、稳定使用的能力（ capacity 、降智），全面不如。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18219538\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4edf/fa6a/101743_normal.png?m=1724133893\" alt=\"xiangran0028\" data-uid=\"101743\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>30</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/xiangran0028\">xiangran0028</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-26 09:21:16 +08:00\">10h 11m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>完全不能和 claude 比，前几天都要取消订阅改用 grok 当备份了，openAI 送了我一个月，只能死缓先留着</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18219580\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/51d35353d2ae93215a7ee9e7e20abe55?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"skuuhui\" data-uid=\"687707\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>31</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/skuuhui\">skuuhui</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-26 09:27:08 +08:00\">10h 5m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>完全没有，codex 已经很努力在追赶了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18219647\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/33cb/b8b1/195688_normal.png?m=1741592455\" alt=\"w3\" data-uid=\"195688\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>32</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/w3\">w3</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-26 09:37:06 +08:00\">9h 55m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/ififi\">ififi</a> #3 Claude $20 都比 GPT $100 耐用</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18219683\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a0abe1a85ec3b31c6a1bb3385db0535d?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Anarchy\" data-uid=\"347960\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>33</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Anarchy\">Anarchy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-26 09:39:57 +08:00\">9h 53m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>单说实现质量，没明确规定的内容 claude 总能实现在我的预期或预期以上，codex 就总能留几个地方的实现让我看着很难受，导致经常要追加对话让 codex 再修改下（ astra 用不起对比是 opus 5.5 vs 6.1 sol ）。再加上 Claude 速度更快、用量更多，codex 属于作为备用都有点不想续费了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18219738\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/63c306cd795f455727bd8a0aca63a98c?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"furlxy\" data-uid=\"334784\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>34</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/furlxy\">furlxy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-26 09:47:44 +08:00\">9h 45m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>sol astra 最近的表现很弱智</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18219843\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/6159/9999/582231_normal.png?m=1791854844\" alt=\"Nasdaq\" data-uid=\"582231\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>36</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Nasdaq\">Nasdaq</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-26 10:00:29 +08:00\">9h 32m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我从来不说 GPT 坏话，因为是 Tibo 收留了俺</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18219870\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/075a/cef6/346323_normal.png?m=1656988446\" alt=\"hakuya7\" data-uid=\"346323\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>37</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/hakuya7\">hakuya7</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-26 10:03:31 +08:00\">9h 29m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 3</span>\n                    \n                    <p>所以 op 到底是想比啥来的……<br>如果是模型，应该是 GPT 比 Claude 。<br>如果是应用，应该是 Codex 比 Claude Code 。<br>如果是公司，应该是 OpenAI 比 Anthropic 。<br>楼上真是咋比的都有😂</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18219872\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/3825841cd470389710fc962eb753e230?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"hanbing135\" data-uid=\"150033\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>38</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/hanbing135\">hanbing135</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-26 10:03:41 +08:00\">9h 29m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>sol 6.1 用到人崩溃 还不如 gemini</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18219936\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4e82/f169/335440_normal.png?m=1779025872\" alt=\"zhishi69\" data-uid=\"335440\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>39</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/zhishi69\">zhishi69</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-26 10:12:39 +08:00\">9h 20m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>回答一个问题很慢，其实我感觉还不如 deepseek</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18219994\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/cbc6/af77/647143_normal.png?m=1749696157\" alt=\"JDSN\" data-uid=\"647143\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>40</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/JDSN\">JDSN</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-26 10:18:54 +08:00\">9h 14m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>那么问题来了，怎么才能安装用上 克劳德 这个大傻逼</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18220014\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/8bc7fc48438ee39eb795ca7c143509aa?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"qishua\" data-uid=\"670047\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>41</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/qishua\">qishua</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-26 10:21:17 +08:00\">9h 11m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>codex 最近降智太严重了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18220110\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/7624630ff4f2bad517fe23a0f81daf6b?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"csfreshman\" data-uid=\"537477\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>42</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/csfreshman\">csfreshman</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-26 10:31:10 +08:00\">9h 1m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>确实，我也是双持，codex plus ,claude 5x ，codex 太啰嗦了，分析问题经常跑偏 <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/NIvxivj.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/NIvxivj.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a></p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18220151\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b0c6/6f54/415795_normal.png?m=1782213343\" alt=\"Leeeeex\" data-uid=\"415795\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>43</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Leeeeex\">Leeeeex</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-26 10:38:05 +08:00\">8h 54m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>codex 已经好几个月没用过了，fable5 发布的时候惊为天人，opus5.5 发布之后就很少再用别的了，5x 根本用不完。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18220228\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/93f3/ada6/130918_normal.png?m=1779345804\" alt=\"dumbass\" data-uid=\"130918\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>45</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/dumbass\">dumbass</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-26 10:46:41 +08:00\">8h 46m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>openAI：明明是我先的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18220305\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/dd54/6e03/273450_normal.png?m=1732790807\" alt=\"yzding\" data-uid=\"273450\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>46</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yzding\">yzding</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-26 10:55:24 +08:00\">8h 37m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我最想吐槽的是 codex 速度非常慢，哪怕开了 fast 也达不到 claude 普通的速度。gpt6.1 sol 安全边界一大堆，经常下达一个命令跑 5 小时额度 30%都不出结果。直到我额度跑完，用了一下 openroute 的 claude haiku5.5 ，比 6.1sol 无论响应速度还是干活遵循比 gpt 好多了。最吃惊的是 haiku5.5 和 gpt6-luna 是一个价格，效果居然比 6.1 sol 还好</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18220633\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/634a/f491/36547_normal.png?m=1791785813\" alt=\"dualface\" data-uid=\"36547\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>47</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/dualface\">dualface</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-26 11:40:05 +08:00\">7h 52m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>gpt 如果不降智缩量，还是可以用的。慢点就多开几个并发。</p><p>但是最恶心的就是降智，这公司真是太小人了。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18220666\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/c205/4a4f/177415_normal.png?m=1465895896\" alt=\"jsjjdzg\" data-uid=\"177415\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>48</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jsjjdzg\">jsjjdzg</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-26 11:45:48 +08:00\">7h 47m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我感觉用 6.1Sol 这不如用 DS4.1F1027 好了。。。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18220975\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/dedad9615a1caf5eea1bd6c217c6ab33?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"duolanengda\" data-uid=\"707592\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>49</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/duolanengda\">duolanengda</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-26 13:15:03 +08:00\">6h 17m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>那些说一直比不上的，是没用过 Claude Opus 4.7/4.8 那一代吗，完全被 gpt-5.5 压着打</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18221019\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/9f9f47246fb5e0cde72ff1c879e629c6?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"kenvix\" data-uid=\"89136\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>50</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/kenvix\">kenvix</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-26 13:24:39 +08:00\">6h 8m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>致敬传奇暗改王 Tibo ，Codex 现在真实 week 额度有没有 claude 的 1/5 都难说，6.1s 降智到快和 haiku 坐一桌<br>我们没有暗改.jpg</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18221589\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/03a0/4432/223857_normal.png?m=1709193364\" alt=\"vipfts\" data-uid=\"223857\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>52</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/vipfts\">vipfts</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-26 14:59:40 +08:00\">4h 33m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>不是说 AI 很厉害吗？让 AI 帮你突破 Anthropic 的封号呀？ <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ug1iMq4.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ug1iMq4.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a></p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18222150\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/cb7e/d3ff/714531_normal.png?m=1761119463\" alt=\"V2Try\" data-uid=\"714531\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>53</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/V2Try\">V2Try</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-26 16:32:24 +08:00\">3h 0m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>鉴定为拉完了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div></DIV>","content_text":"1 v2gba 1 day ago 除了 astra~opus5.5 的期间, 综合考虑都比不上吧. (个人使用下来的综合评分)当然我觉得 Codex 还是有不少比 Claude 好的地方. 依旧保持双持的状态. 2 ififi 1 day ago 今天刚被 Claude 封，一下从 Opus 5.5 切到 Astra 和 6.1 Sol 。第一感觉就是慢，第二感觉就是笨。戒断反应来了。 3 ififi 1 day ago @ififi 补充：Claude Design 和 Canvas 功能也是独一档。Max 5x 的耐用程度远超 Pro 100 刀。要不是 Tibo 搞的三天两头重置，人估计都跑 Claude 去了。 4 zfyime 1 day ago 起码编程方面是opus-4.5 一路用过来gpt 从来没有能代替的时候 永远啰里八嗦 无效兜底 车轱辘话 分散的屎山代码往上糊 6 111111111111 22h 30m ago claude web 和 chatgpt 感觉差别不大claude code 和 codex 的差距明显，不知道为什么 7 coderlxm 21h 49m ago 从 opus5.5 发布到现在这段时间差距太明显了，基本上是不可用的状态。不过我说句暴论，要是 a 畜不封号，涌进来的用户量也会分分钟把 opus 降智到 luna 的水平。 8 skylong8 21h 36m ago 3 我之所以现在还在用 Codex 是因为 Claude 会封号。 9 liudon 21h 26m ago 十一假期回来，又慢又笨。 12 dragonQueen 20h 29m ago 我是主要觉得 claude 的自动模式太香了，几乎不需要手动确认了； codex 的即使开了 full access ，偶尔也还是需要手动授权。要是睡之前开个任务，claude 基本上第二天早上能交付，但是 codex 就看运气了 13 ndxxx 20h 24m ago via Android 都在用，opus5.5 medium 和 sol6.1 medium 用来 coding 体感差距不大（ fable 和 astra 我嫌慢且体会不到相对于本家 opus 和 sol 的编码提升），当然前提是我给到的设计文档质量足够。许愿式编码确实 opus5.5 更胜一筹😁 17 vverr 19h 48m ago TMD 之前速度还行 今天频繁报 429 啊 18 cctv180 19h 44m ago curso 用户路过，爱调用 opus-5-5 模型，很少使用 gemini 和 gpt 模型 19 loopq 19h 35m ago via iPhone O 家，gpt5.6 前后体验天壤之别，后面就算给我重置也不太想用了，又慢又蠢。Astra 贵的离谱Claude Pro 用量挺多的，我记得几个月之前 Pro 用量也是很少的，后面对抗 O 重置有 50% 活动之后，也是能当主力用段时间，可以完整规划然后用其他模型实施了。 20 Alwaysonline 19h 29m ago 1 Claude 是你仰慕佩服的技术大拿， Codex 是刚分配给你带的新人。真没招 A/ 完全不给人机会用，封号到无助。 21 lambdaX999 19h 25m ago codex 能力还是可以，就是这个 5 小时额度给的太少了，如果用量加大点还是可以跟 opus 打的有来有回，估计是 sam 这边算力不够了，opus 现在有了 elon 的算力加持，感觉是要对 codex 进行围剿了 23 HappyAndSmile 18h 15m ago 1 我刚刚今晚花了 300 人民币在 claude 中转里，我有大量 Codex 都不用，怎么说，没办法啊，一遇到关键问题，Codex 就完成不了，只能用 claude 去搞定。谁要是跟我说 Codex 差不多的话，我都是笑笑不说话 24 dxppp 17h 48m ago 所以我都 AI Orchestration Claude Opus 5.5 当 Supervisor 监督 GPT 这些 Workers 干活 效果不错 25 yang1iu 17h 13m ago 1 不是越来越比不上，是一直没比上过 27 Ethkuil 10h 31m ago via Android 跟 Claude Opus 5.5 合作身心愉悦，跟 Astra 合作血压升高。对我来说真的差距很大。 28 elevioux 10h 30m ago opeanai 相比 anthropic ，感觉 opanai 才是那个跟随者，无论模型能力还是 harness 本身。 29 Ethkuil 10h 29m ago via Android 做事能力、写文档能力、稳定使用的能力（ capacity 、降智），全面不如。 30 xiangran0028 10h 11m ago 完全不能和 claude 比，前几天都要取消订阅改用 grok 当备份了，openAI 送了我一个月，只能死缓先留着 31 skuuhui 10h 5m ago 完全没有，codex 已经很努力在追赶了。 32 w3 9h 55m ago @ififi #3 Claude $20 都比 GPT $100 耐用 33 Anarchy 9h 53m ago 单说实现质量，没明确规定的内容 claude 总能实现在我的预期或预期以上，codex 就总能留几个地方的实现让我看着很难受，导致经常要追加对话让 codex 再修改下（ astra 用不起对比是 opus 5.5 vs 6.1 sol ）。再加上 Claude 速度更快、用量更多，codex 属于作为备用都有点不想续费了。 34 furlxy 9h 45m ago sol astra 最近的表现很弱智 36 Nasdaq 